WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:08.064
Hi! Today we learn the articles: der, die, das.

2
00:00:08.464 --> 00:00:11.904
Every noun has an article.

3
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:19.104
German has three articles: der, die and das. Listen:

4
00:00:19.504 --> 00:00:21.624
the key

5
00:00:22.024 --> 00:00:24.192
the lamp

6
00:00:24.592 --> 00:00:26.664
the book

7
00:00:27.064 --> 00:00:29.472
the computer

8
00:00:29.872 --> 00:00:31.944
the bag

9
00:00:32.344 --> 00:00:34.536
the car

10
00:00:36.233 --> 00:00:43.417
My tip: learn every word with its article. Not just Tisch, but:

11
00:00:43.817 --> 00:00:45.889
der Tisch!

12
00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:50.944
A few tips help you guess:

13
00:00:51.344 --> 00:00:55.456
Words ending in -ung take die: die Zeitung.

14
00:00:55.856 --> 00:01:00.280
Words ending in -e often take die: die Lampe.

15
00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:04.840
Words ending in -chen take das: das Mädchen.

16
00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:10.549
For things we also say er, sie, es.

17
00:01:10.949 --> 00:01:13.573
Where is the key?

18
00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:16.045
It's here.

19
00:01:16.445 --> 00:01:20.605
der becomes er, die becomes sie, das becomes es.

20
00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:26.748
Listen: Lena and Mateo are looking for things.

21
00:01:27.148 --> 00:01:29.580
Is this your book?

22
00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:33.372
No, that's not my book.

23
00:01:33.772 --> 00:01:36.036
And the bag?

24
00:01:36.436 --> 00:01:39.636
Yes, that's my bag.

25
00:01:40.036 --> 00:01:42.660
Where is the key?

26
00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:45.468
It's in the car!

27
00:01:47.167 --> 00:01:55.575
Now you! Look around. What do you see? Say the word with its article!

28
00:02:04.267 --> 00:02:08.403
Great! Now you can:

29
00:02:08.803 --> 00:02:15.291
You know der, die, das, a few tips and er, sie, es for things.

30
00:02:15.691 --> 00:02:17.811
See you soon!
